  "title": "Bud's Potato Salad",
  "description": "In this yummy salad, sliced and cooled potatoes are doused with a vinegar, sugar, and water bath and chilled for twelve hours. At the last moment, mayonnaise, celery seeds, and diced onion are folded in.",
  "authors": [
    "DIANA_LESLIE"
